  "source_path": "Early f_locals access refreshes a live frame to an eager dict (runtime.cpp1830-1835); retirement previously updated only lazy compact snapshots (1973), preserving earlier values and missing later assignments.",
  "scope": "At physical non-entry function retirement only, refresh an already-materialized plain unbacked locals dict in place. Preserve escaped mapping identity; filter hidden/Invalid slots with existing snapshot builder; invalidate all three index proofs. Existing lazy retirement, module/eval entry aliases, logical-frame projections, observer order, thread mutex and normal/unwind callers unchanged.",
  "ownership": "Fresh snapshot owns final values before swapping entries. The outer private dict holds displaced old values and cannot release them until registry removal/live=false and mutex unlock are complete. Public reentrant cleanup test reacquires the registry mutex.",
